        "kind": "text",
        "name": "limits-1-title",
        "order": 3,
        "stackingPath": [
          0
        ],
        "frame": {
          "left": 55,
          "top": 214.5,
          "width": 414.797,
          "height": 26,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "text": "一是势能到动能阻力重重。",
        "style": {
          "typeface": "Microsoft YaHei",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontSizePt": 15,
          "bold": true,
          "italic": false,
          "color": "#242424",
          "alignment": "left",
          "verticalAlignment": "top",
          "wrap": "none",
          "fontFit": "unchanged",
          "originalFontSizePt": 15,
          "lineSpacing": 1.3
        },
        "shadow": "shadow-none"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "limits-1-body",
        "order": 4,
        "stackingPath": [
          0
        ],
        "frame": {
          "left": 55,
          "top": 243.5,
          "width": 414.797,
          "height": 102,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "text": "完成顶层设计后，变革落地就是关键。现阶段公司\n内部人力资源变革氛围尚未完全形成，信息系统支\n撑能力仍存在差距，缺乏市场化的管理机制，造成\n变革落地阻力重重。",
        "style": {
          "typeface": "Microsoft YaHei",
          "fontSize": 18.75,
          "fontSizePt": 14.063,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "color": "#454545",
          "alignment": "left",
          "verticalAlignment": "top",
          "wrap": "square",
          "fontFit": "unchanged",
          "originalFontSizePt": 14.063,
          "lineSpacing": 1.36
        },
        "shadow": "shadow-none"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "limits-2-title",
        "order": 5,
        "stackingPath": [
          0
        ],
        "frame": {
          "left": 55,
          "top": 362.5,
          "width": 414.797,
          "height": 26,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "text": "二是合规管理短板亟待提升。",
        "style": {
          "typeface": "Microsoft YaHei",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontSizePt": 15,
          "bold": true,
          "italic": false,
          "color": "#242424",
          "alignment": "left",
          "verticalAlignment": "top",
          "wrap": "none",
          "fontFit": "unchanged",
          "originalFontSizePt": 15,
          "lineSpacing": 1.3
        },
        "shadow": "shadow-none"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "limits-2-body",
        "order": 6,
        "stackingPath": [
          0
        ],
        "frame": {
          "left": 55,
          "top": 391.5,
          "width": 414.797,
          "height": 102,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "text": "2017年的巡视整改虽然取得了一定成效，但也充\n分暴露出人力条线基础管理薄弱的问题，反映出条\n线内部认识有待提升、作风有待转变、能力有待增\n强、协同有待深化。",
        "style": {
          "typeface": "Microsoft YaHei",
          "fontSize": 18.75,
          "fontSizePt": 14.063,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "color": "#454545",
          "alignment": "left",
          "verticalAlignment": "top",
          "wrap": "square",
          "fontFit": "unchanged",
          "originalFontSizePt": 14.063,
          "lineSpacing": 1.36
        },
        "shadow": "shadow-none"
      },
      {
