          "width": 715.203,
          "height": 32.5,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "text": "其次是四点感悟。",
        "style": {
          "typeface": "Microsoft YaHei",
          "fontSize": 25,
          "fontSizePt": 18.75,
          "bold": true,
          "italic": false,
          "color": "#242424",
          "alignment": "left",
          "verticalAlignment": "top",
          "wrap": "none",
          "fontFit": "unchanged",
          "originalFontSizePt": 18.75,
          "lineSpacing": 1.3
        },
        "shadow": "shadow-none"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "insights-1-title",
        "order": 9,
        "stackingPath": [
          0
        ],
        "frame": {
          "left": 509.797,
          "top": 214.5,
          "width": 715.203,
          "height": 26,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "text": "一是统一语言才能合拍共鸣。",
        "style": {
          "typeface": "Microsoft YaHei",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontSizePt": 15,
          "bold": true,
          "italic": false,
          "color": "#242424",
          "alignment": "left",
          "verticalAlignment": "top",
          "wrap": "none",
          "fontFit": "unchanged",
          "originalFontSizePt": 15,
          "lineSpacing": 1.3
        },
        "shadow": "shadow-none"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "insights-1-body",
        "order": 10,
        "stackingPath": [
          0
        ],
        "frame": {
          "left": 509.797,
          "top": 243.5,
          "width": 715.203,
          "height": 76.5,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "text": "要想真正解决人力资源与业务两张皮的问题，就要沿用BLM管理模型，与业务单位统一\n语言、统一目标、统一策略，实现从业务战略到人力资源战略的规划设计端到端人力资\n源落地解决方案，达成“三个市场化”转型目标。",
        "style": {
          "typeface": "Microsoft YaHei",
          "fontSize": 18.75,
          "fontSizePt": 14.063,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "color": "#454545",
          "alignment": "left",
          "verticalAlignment": "top",
          "wrap": "square",
          "fontFit": "unchanged",
          "originalFontSizePt": 14.063,
          "lineSpacing": 1.36
        },
        "shadow": "shadow-none"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "insights-2-title",
        "order": 11,
        "stackingPath": [
          0
        ],
        "frame": {
          "left": 509.797,
          "top": 328,
          "width": 715.203,
          "height": 26,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "text": "二是解决问题才是检验变革的唯一标准。",
        "style": {
          "typeface": "Microsoft YaHei",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontSizePt": 15,
          "bold": true,
          "italic": false,
          "color": "#242424",
          "alignment": "left",
          "verticalAlignment": "top",
          "wrap": "none",
          "fontFit": "unchanged",
          "originalFontSizePt": 15,
          "lineSpacing": 1.3
        },
        "shadow": "shadow-none"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "insights-2-body",
        "order": 12,
        "stackingPath": [
          0
        ],
        "frame": {
          "left": 509.797,
          "top": 357,
          "width": 715.203,
          "height": 51,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "text": "体系变革是否成效，要以能否“解决实际问题”为唯一检验标准，力求变革落地有实\n效。",
        "style": {
          "typeface": "Microsoft YaHei",
          "fontSize": 18.75,
          "fontSizePt": 14.063,
          "bold": false,
          "italic": false,
          "color": "#454545",
          "alignment": "left",
          "verticalAlignment": "top",
          "wrap": "square",
          "fontFit": "unchanged",
          "originalFontSizePt": 14.063,
          "lineSpacing": 1.36
        },
        "shadow": "shadow-none"
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "name": "insights-3-title",
        "order": 13,
        "stackingPath": [
          0
        ],
        "frame": {
          "left": 509.797,
          "top": 416,
          "width": 715.203,
          "height": 26,
          "rotation": 0
        },
        "text": "三是顶层设计没有完结篇。",
        "style": {
          "typeface": "Microsoft YaHei",
          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontSizePt": 15,
          "bold": true,
          "italic": false,
          "color": "#242424",
          "alignment": "left",
          "verticalAlignment": "top",
          "wrap": "none",
          "fontFit": "unchanged",
          "originalFontSizePt": 15,
          "lineSpacing": 1.3
